      "writtenOn": "2017-08-09T00:20:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Kati\u0027s find emulator ignores EACCES due to a partner filed bug for this use case:\n\nhttps://issuetracker.google.com/37553659\nhttps://github.com/google/kati/pull/116\n\nWe could still abort on other errors however.",
      "parentUuid": "c1d6d82f_df54a738",
      "revId": "b6d161bf16031e06fc8d532e35a53c73ad20f84f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "41e16990_9f0f76c4",
        "filename": "finder/finder.go",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 1148,
