      "writtenOn": "2017-08-09T20:04:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you have opinions about the mechanism by which the error is propagated?\n\nFor example, do you want to treat it like the WaitGroup, where there\u0027s a variable attached to Finder that stores any errors encountered, which gets checked after the search completes, and then gets returned as an extra return from New ?",
      "parentUuid": "41e16990_9f0f76c4",
      "revId": "b6d161bf16031e06fc8d532e35a53c73ad20f84f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
